// @check
// @error constant 0xFFFFFFFF does not fit `u8` (0..=255) — `as?` on it would be null on every run
// @error constant 0x80000000 does not fit `u8` (0..=255) — `as?` on it would be null on every run
// @error constant -0x1 does not fit `u8` (0..=255) — `as?` on it would be null on every run
// @error constant 0xFFFFFFFF does not fit `u8` (0..=255) — `as!` on it would trap on every run
// A radix constant cast from `i32` into an integer domain is judged as the `i32` its pattern is
// (D3053), so one with bit 31 set misfits `u8` as its decimal does.
print(0xFFFFFFFF as? u8)
print(0x80000000 as? u8)
print((-0x1) as? u8)
print(0xFFFFFFFF as! u8)
